{"3048990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silicium", "steam_appid": 3048990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/3412b07a1d3f441c6d1c454eaf1183e2.avif?t=1779205773\" width=1188 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silicium is a harsh survival game where you play a disposable mining robot sent to a hostile planet. Mine, refine and automate. Export your quota for corporate or die trying. Play solo, co-op or join ruthless 24/7 PvP servers. Unlock new blueprints each run and try again with new possibilities.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTRACT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract precious resources to craft new items. Each resource requires the proper tool to be mined. The better the tool, the faster the harvest. Upgrade your gear to reach the most valuable mineral of all: Silicium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/dd95dccdd53ff166d5c5341e0468b6a7.poster.avif?t=1779205773\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/dd95dccdd53ff166d5c5341e0468b6a7.webm?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/dd95dccdd53ff166d5c5341e0468b6a7.mp4?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>BUILD</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base to secure your loot and defend against enemies. Level up to learn crafting recipes of items and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/4b0dbffe064b42ae21385dc9e5366e57.poster.avif?t=1779205773\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/4b0dbffe064b42ae21385dc9e5366e57.webm?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/4b0dbffe064b42ae21385dc9e5366e57.mp4?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPORT</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch transport rockets to export ores into space and get your paycheck. Craft smelting equipment to refine ores for higher value and improved efficiency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/196a9be264099be6b662e90c4f93331f.poster.avif?t=1779205773\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/196a9be264099be6b662e90c4f93331f.webm?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/196a9be264099be6b662e90c4f93331f.mp4?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planet to scavenge abandoned mining sites. But beware, corrupted mining drones have turned hostile and attack without warning.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/e39664f21ba8376d2a3de68758d2ecc7.poster.avif?t=1779205773\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/e39664f21ba8376d2a3de68758d2ecc7.webm?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/e39664f21ba8376d2a3de68758d2ecc7.mp4?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or compete in public PvP servers where the action never stops. Can you outsmart the competition and extract the most resources? </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means starting over, but your earnings unlock new crafting recipes for your next run. No persistent bases. No offline raids. Every session is a fresh battle for survival where only active players compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/ed84a7da329db049347ad5fed1ffc75d.poster.avif?t=1779205773\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/ed84a7da329db049347ad5fed1ffc75d.webm?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048990/extras/ed84a7da329db049347ad5fed1ffc75d.mp4?t=1779205773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.